{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "John Meets Sandra"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "What's Happening?"}, {"type": "position", "content": 3}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 7}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe characteristics of different people and their jobs."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le07ob03re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The First Conditional "}, {"type": "describer", "content": " "}, {"type": "text", "content": "The first conditional can be used in the positive form.<br><span class=\"italic\">Example: If I get a high-paying job, I will buy new work clothes.</span> <br><br>The first conditional can also be used in the negative form.<br><span class=\"italic\">Example: If I don't get a high-paying job, I won't buy new work clothes.</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "After I pass my test, I will look for a better job. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "When I get a high-paying job, I might need to buy new work clothes. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Once I start making a lot of money, I will go on a cruise."}, {"type": "text", "content": " You can also use the first conditional starting with <span class=\"italic\">when</span> and <span class=\"italic\">after</span>.<br>You can start the sentence with <span class=\"italic\">when</span>, <span class=\"italic\">after</span> and <span class=\"italic\">once</span> to say what the result will be when you  do something or after you  finish an action."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "I've had it "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "You say this when you had enough putting up with something difficult or unpleasant."}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: I've had it with going up and down on a ship."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le07ob03aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about your career."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "leave of absence"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a period of time away from your regular job "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: John is taking a leave of absence from his job on the ship."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le07ob03aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to be on board "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " to agree with others or to join "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Everyone in the office is on board with the new idea."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le07ob03aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "tremendous"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "very large or excellent "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This new job has tremendous benefits for my career."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le07ob03aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "tourism "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the industry related to travel "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: John doesn't want to stay in the tourism industry on the ship."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le07ob03aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "professional development "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " learning related to a career"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: The professional development workshop I went to really helped me."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le07ob03aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "finance"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "any area related to money "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Peter is interested in a career in finance."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le07ob03aud07"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "What skills do you hold fro