e. Nice to be on dry land?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Yeah, I've had it on the waves for a while. Good to see you, Peter.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Did you take a leave of absence?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: A short one. Did you get the job with the investment firm?<br>", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le07ob03re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: No, not yet! Once I get on board, it holds tremendous potential for my career.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: I agree. For my career, I'm unsure if I want to stay in the tourism industry.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: If you move to another field, your skills can transfer over.<br>", "id": 2, "time": "14000", "image": "engenn5le07ob03re2img07.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: True. There is a professional development workshop coming up on the ship.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I went to a PD workshop before. If you go, you'll figure out if you like tourism.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: The topic is customer service, which sounds interesting.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I hope you get a lot out of it.", "id": 3, "time": "30000", "image": "engenn5le07ob03re2img06.jpg"}]}}]}, {"id": 2, "type": "text", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "p", "value": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Hey, John. Welcome home. Nice to be on dry land?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Yeah, I've had it on the waves for a while. Good to see you, Peter.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Did you take a leave of absence?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: A short one. Did you get the job with the investment firm?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: No, not yet! Once I get on board, it holds tremendous potential for my career.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: I agree. For my career, I'm unsure if I want to stay in the tourism industry.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: If you move to another field, your skills can transfer over.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: True. There's a professional development workshop coming up on the ship.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I went to a PD workshop before. If you go, you'll figure out if you like tourism.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: The topic is customer service, which sounds interesting.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I hope you get a lot out of it."}]}]}], "type": "sena"}